{
"start": 4415.37,
"end": 4423.36,
"text": " that Martin Bashir's documentary was not a true representation of the interviews that actually took place, there is one question that many people share."
},
{
"start": 4423.68,
"end": 4432.61,
"text": "How could Michael Jackson, a 44 year old man who has spent most of his life in the spotlight, have allowed himself to open up to a virtual stranger?"
},
{
"start": 4432.97,
"end": 4436.47,
"text": "This footage from Michael's camera may give you a better understanding."
}
